A guided review of every game.
- Review a finished game step by step, with a progress bar while it analyses
- A short summary first: accuracy for you and Stockfish, and a graph
- Walk through your mistakes with Next, each marked on the board and explained simply
- Show the better move as an arrow, or try again to find it yourself
- Your full analysis workspace is still there under Explore this game
- Puzzles show wrong moves on the board with Retry, and Reveal draws the solution
- Lessons give feedback above the board; coordinate training has a visible countdown
